<Layout title="Website process | Virgil Digital" description="How Virgil Digital builds new websites and improves existing ones, from first audit to launch.">
  <span class="kicker">The process</span><h1>Clear from first call to <span class="accent">launch.</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">The same practical process whether you are starting from nothing or bringing an existing website back up to standard.</p>
  <h2>For a new website</h2><ol><li><strong>Audit and direction.</strong> We clarify the customer, offer, pages, and next action.</li><li><strong>Content and design.</strong> You provide the facts and assets; I shape them into a proven structure.</li><li><strong>Build and review.</strong> The Astro site is built, tested on mobile, and reviewed with your feedback.</li><li><strong>Launch.</strong> Forms, links, metadata, performance, and deployment are checked before it goes live.</li></ol>
  <h2>For an existing website</h2><ol><li><strong>Audit first.</strong> I review the current design, mobile experience, content, speed, forms, analytics, domain, and hosting.</li><li><strong>Protect what works.</strong> Useful URLs, search metadata, copy, and integrations are recorded before changes.</li><li><strong>Choose refresh or rebuild.</strong> A refresh starts from £499 when the existing foundation is usable. A rebuild is quoted when it is not.</li><li><strong>Test and release.</strong> The updated site is checked, redirected where needed, and launched with a rollback plan.</li></ol>
  <a href="/contact/" class="btn">Request an audit</a>
</Layout>
